OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fspreading north in the morning, but
OL,7,Fbecoming drier for a time in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with some bright spells
OL,9,Fpossible. Further rain spreading north
OL,10,Flate in the afternoon heavy at times.
OL,11,FVery warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain spreading north,
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times and perhaps
OL,16,Fquite persistent in the southeast with
OL,17,Fsome drier spells developing in the
OL,18,Fwest overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
