OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy in the morning with
OL,6,Fsome rain or drizzle. Some showers
OL,7,Fbreaking out in the afternoon,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy and perhaps
OL,9,Fthundery, but also some bright spells
OL,10,Fbreaking through at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fand cloudy with showers or longer
OL,14,Fspells of rain on Wednesday. Drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter with just a few showers on
OL,16,FThursday. Showery rain from the west
OL,17,Fon Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
